01:46:24,067 --> 01:46:26,547
Entahlah. Kondisinya cukup bagus.

1086
01:46:27,865 --> 01:46:29,467
Itu pas.

1087
01:46:34,413 --> 01:46:36,165
Hei, kau mau menikah denganku?

1088
01:46:39,043 --> 01:46:40,670
Diam.

1089
01:46:42,879 --> 01:46:46,425
Aku tak mau diam.
Kau mau menikah denganku?

1090
01:46:55,304 --> 01:46:56,618
Ya.

1091
01:46:57,757 --> 01:46:59,789
Ya, aku sangat mau.

1092
01:47:00,272 --> 01:47:01,999
Aku sangat mencintaimu.

1093
01:47:06,946 --> 01:47:09,924
- Apa?
- Bukan apa-apa! Oke, duduk di sini.

1094
01:47:10,549 --> 01:47:14,119
